<title>HUNGARY: Hungary c.bank abolishes its six-mth, 12-mth depo.</title>
<headline>Hungary c.bank abolishes its six-mth, 12-mth depo.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Hungary said on its  NBHI Reuters page on Thursday that it abolished its six-month and 12-month deposit facilities.</p>
<p>&quot;The NBH's six-month deposit facility ceased,&quot; the NBH said. &quot;The NBH does not accept 12-month deposits,&quot; it added.</p>
</text>
